k of a crash or driver injury.","remedy":"Chrysler will notify owners, and dealers will inspect the air bag wiring within the steering wheel, replacing it if necessary.  A protective cover will also be installed.  These repairs will be made free of charge.  Owners may contact Chrysler customer service at 1-800-853-1403.  Chrysler's number for this recall is T33.","park_it":false,"park_outside":false,"over_the_air":false,"has_potential_units":true,"potential_units":209135,"potential_units_source_url":"https://api.nhtsa.gov/recalls/campaignNumber?campaignNumber=17V376000","potential_units_source_title":"NHTSA Recalls API (campaignNumber)","campaign_vehicle_count":2,"campaign_vehicles":[{"year":"2012","make":"DODGE","model":"GRAND CARAVAN"},{"year":"2011","make":"DODGE","model":"GRAND CARAVAN"}],"campaign_vehicles_truncated":false},{"campaign":"14V234000","received":"2014-05-07","manufacturer":"Chrysler Group LLC","component":"ELECTRICAL SYSTEM","summary":"Chrysler Group, LLC (Chrysler) is recalling certain model year 2010-2014 Chrysler Town and Country and Dodge Grand Caravan vehicles manufactured August 25, 2010, through October 31, 2013.  The affected vehicles may experience overheating of the vent window switch in the driver's door armrest.","consequence":"An overheated switch may result in a vehicle fire.","remedy":"Chrysler will notify owners, and dealers will replace the vent window switch with a newer version, free of charge.  The owner notification letter was issued and the remedy campaign launched on on December 31, 2014.  Owners may contact Chrysler customer service at 1-800-853-1403.  Chrysler's number for this recall is P25.","park_it":false,"park_outside":false,"over_the_air":false,"has_potential_units":true,"potential_units":644757,"potential_units_source_url":"https://api.nhtsa.gov/recalls/campaignNumber?campaignNumber=14V234000","potential_units_source_title":"NHTSA Recalls API (campaignNumber)","campaign_vehicle_count":10,"campaign_vehicles":[{"year":"2010","make":"DODGE","model":"GRAND CARAVAN"},{"year":"2012","make":"DODGE","model":"GRAND CARAVAN"},{"year":"2012","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"TOWN AND COUNTRY"},{"year":"2011","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"TOWN AND COUNTRY"},{"year":"2013","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"TOWN AND COUNTRY"},{"year":"2010","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"TOWN AND COUNTRY"},{"year":"2014","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"TOWN AND COUNTRY"},{"year":"2013","make":"DODGE","model":"GRAND CARAVAN"},{"year":"2011","make":"DODGE","model":"GRAND CARAVAN"},{"year":"2014","make":"DODGE","model":"GRAND CARAVAN"}],"campaign_vehicles_truncated":false},{"campaign":"12V141000","received":"2012-04-03","manufacturer":"CHRYSLER GROUP LLC","component":"SUSPENSION:REAR","summary":"CHRYSLER IS RECALLING CERTAIN MODEL YEAR 2012 TOWN AND COUNTRY AND DODGE GRAND CARAVAN VEHICLES MANUFACTURED FROM NOVEMBER 15, 2011, THROUGH NOVEMBER 21, 2011.  SOME VEHICLES MAY BE EQUIPPED WITH RIGHT REAR HUB AND BEARING ASSEMBLIES THAT WERE NOT FULLY MACHINED.","consequence":"THIS COULD RESULT IN A DECREASE IN DURABILITY, WHICH MAY LEAD TO WHEEL SEPARATION, INCREASING THE RISK OF A CRASH.","remedy":"CHRYSLER WILL NOTIFY OWNERS, AND DEALERS WILL REPLACE THE RIGHT REAR HUB AND BEARING ASSEMBLY, FREE OF CHARGE.  THE SAFETY RECALL BEGAN ON APRIL 27, 2012.  OWNERS MAY CONTACT CHRYSLER AT 1-800-853-1403.","park_it":false,"park_outside":false,"over_the_air":false,"has_potential_units":true,"potential_units":289,"potential_units_source_url":"https://api.nhtsa.gov/recalls/campaignNumber?campaignNumber=12V141000","potential_units_source_title":"NHTSA Recalls API (campaignNumber)","campaign_vehicle_count":2,"campaign_vehicles":[{"year":"2012","make":"DODGE","model":"GRAND CARAVAN"},{"year":"2012","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"TOWN AND COUNTRY"}],"campaign_vehicles_truncated":false},{"campaign":"11V487000","received":"2011-09-29","manufacturer":"CHRYSLER GROUP LLC","component":"ENGINE AND ENGINE COOLING","summary":"CHRYSLER IS RECALLING CERTAIN MODEL YEAR 2012 CHRYSLER VEHICLES, INCLUDING 200 AND TOWN AND COUNTRY MODELS, DODGE VEHICLES, INCLUDING CHARGER, DURANGO, GRAND CARAVAN AND JOURNEY MODELS AND JEEP GRAND CHEROKEE VEHICLES MANUFACTURED FROM AUGUST 31, 2011, THROUGH SEPTEMBER 13, 2011, THAT ARE EQUIPPED WITH 3.6L ENGINES.   THESE ENGINES MAY EXPERIENCE CONNECTING ROD BEARING FAILURE DUE TO DEBRIS INSIDE THE ENGINE BLOCK.","consequence":"CONNECTING ROD FAILURE MAY LEAD TO ENGINE SEIZURE WHICH MAY INCREASE THE RISK OF A CRASH.","remedy":"CHRYSLER WILL NOTIFY OWNERS AND REPLACE THE ENGINE FREE OF CHARGE.  THE SAFETY RECALL IS EXPECTED TO BEGIN ON OR ABOUT NOVEMBER 18, 2011.  OWNERS MAY CONTACT CHRYSLER AT 1-800-853-1403.","park_it":false,"park_outside":false,"over_the_air":false,"has_potential_units":true,"potential_units":667,"potential_units_source_url":"https://api.nhtsa.gov/recalls/campaignNumber?campaignNumber=11V487000","potential_units_source_title":"NHTSA Recalls API (campaignNumber)","campaign_vehicle_count":7,"campaign_vehicles":[{"year":"2012","make":"DODGE","model":"GRAND CARAVAN"},{"year":"2012","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"200"},{"year":"2012","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"TOWN AND COUNTRY"},{"year":"2012","make":"DODGE","model":"CHARGER"},{"year":"2012","make":"DODGE","model":"DURANGO"},{"year":"2012","make":"JEEP","model":"GRAND CHEROKEE"},{"year":"2012","make":"DODGE","model":"JOURNEY"}],"campaign_vehicles_truncated":false},{"campaign":"12V191000","received":"2012-05-02","manufacturer":"CHRYSLER GROUP LLC","component":"EQUIPMENT","summary":"CHRYSLER IS RECALLING CERTAIN MODEL YEAR 2012 TOWN AND COUNTRY AND DODGE GRAND CARAVAN VEHICLES, MANUFACTURED FROM MARCH 9, 2012 THROUGH MARCH 12, 2012. SOME VEHICLES MAY BE EQUIPPED WITH A RIGHT SIDE LIFTGATE PINCH SENSOR THAT DOES NOT FUNCTION PROPERLY.  AS A RESULT, INCREASED FORCE MAY BE REQUIRED IN ORDER TO STOP THE POWER LIFTGATE DURING FINAL CLOSING STAGES.","consequence":"THE POWER LIFTGATE DOOR MAY CLOSE ON AN APPENDAGE, INCREASING THE RISK OF INJURY.","remedy":"CHRYSLER WILL NOTIFY OWNERS, AND DEALERS WILL INSPECT AND REPLACE THE RIGHT SIDE LIFTGATE PINCH SENSORS, FREE OF CHARGE.  THE SAFETY RECALL BEGAN ON MAY 18, 2012.  OWNERS MAY CONTACT CHRYSLER AT 1-800-853-1403.","park_it":false,"park_outside":false,"over_the_air":false,"has_potential_units":true,"potential_units":471,"potential_units_source_url":"https://api.nhtsa.gov/recalls/campaignNumber?campaignNumber=12V191000","potential_units_source_title":"NHTSA Recalls API (campaignNumber)","campaign_vehicle_count":2,"campaign_vehicles":[{"year":"2012","make":"DODGE","model":"GRAND CARAVAN"},{"year":"2012","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"TOWN AND COUNTRY"}],"campaign_vehicles_truncated":false},{"campaign":"25V876000","received":"2025-12-18","manufacturer":"Rollx Vans","component":"EQUIPMENT ADAPTIVE/MOBILITY:WHEELCHAIR RESTRAINTS/SECUREMENT:LATCH/ANCHOR:","summary":"Rollx Vans (Rollx) is recalling certain GMC Yukon, Sierra, Chevrolet Express 2500, Ford Transit, E-250, Toyota Sienna, Sienna Hybrid, Honda Odyssey, Chrysler Town and Country, Voyager, Pacifica, Dodge Grand Caravan, and Ram Promaster vehicles equipped with QRT-Deluxe and QRT-Max wheelchair restraints. Please refer to Rollx's recall report for specific model year information. The retractors may not lock, preventing the wheelchair from being properly secured.","consequence":"An unsecured wheelchair can move during transit, increasing the risk of injury.","remedy":"Rollx will work with Q'Straint to inspect and replace the retractors as necessary, free of charge. Owner notification letters were mailed February 5, 2026. Owners may contact Rollx's customer service at 1-800-956-6668.","park_it":false,"park_outside":false,"over_the_air":false,"has_potential_units":true,"potential_units":86,"potential_units_source_url":"https://api.nhtsa.gov/recalls/campaignNumber?campaignNumber=25V876000","potential_units_source_title":"NHTSA Recalls API (campaignNumber)","campaign_vehicle_count":52,"campaign_vehicles":[{"year":"2024","make":"TOYOTA","model":"SIENNA HYBRID"},{"year":"2023","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"VOYAGER"},{"year":"2024","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"PACIFICA"},{"year":"2024","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"VOYAGER"},{"year":"2024","make":"RAM","model":"PROMASTER"},{"year":"2024","make":"FORD","model":"TRANSIT"},{"year":"2025","make":"TOYOTA","model":"SIENNA HYBRID"},{"year":"2025","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"PACIFICA"},{"year":"2025","make":"RAM","model":"PROMASTER"},{"year":"2025","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"VOYAGER"},{"year":"2025","make":"GMC","model":"YUKON"},{"year":"2025","make":"GMC","model":"SIERRA 1500"},{"year":"2025","make":"FORD","model":"TRANSIT"},{"year":"2021","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"PACIFICA"},{"year":"2010","make":"DODGE","model":"GRAND CARAVAN"},{"year":"2011","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"TOWN AND COUNTRY"},{"year":"2012","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"TOWN AND COUNTRY"},{"year":"2013","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"TOWN AND COUNTRY"},{"year":"2014","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"TOWN AND COUNTRY"},{"year":"2015","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"TOWN AND COUNTRY"},{"year":"2019","make":"FORD","model":"TRANSIT"},{"year":"2019","make":"RAM","model":"PROMASTER"},{"year":"2011","make":"FORD","model":"E-250"},{"year":"2011","make":"DODGE","model":"GRAND CARAVAN"}],"campaign_vehicles_truncated":true}]}
